":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OUZAQKU79SM9"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OUZAQKU79SM9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.E_bVqUiLxFQvwsNh\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1OUZAQKU79SM9","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OUZAQKU79SM9"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.E_bVqUiLxFQvwsNh","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.E_bVqUiLxFQvwsNh"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/17894892?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3896553426"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qyk0RdDR8QuJ5toyavnHKA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qyk0RdDR8QuJ5toyavnHKA","creator":{"__ref":"User:17894892"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1618352617722,"createdAt":1618261610273,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1618262325721,"text":"I don't read much romance and the romance I do read is classified as fantasy with some romance like ACOTAR etc. I would say this one is more romance with a dash of fantasy. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI liked the witty dialogue between characters like Aleksandr and his business associates, the moments with MC Amani's family, the moments between Aleksandr/Amani outside of the bedroom, and the bits of fantasy/displays of fantasy.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI would have liked the romance to be slower burn with more backstory about the witches and vampires, less bedroom scenes and more displays of magic, and more witty dialogue between characters so we can see their attraction develop into a deeper love story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI still really enjoyed it and will read Book 2 and more by the author Courtney Dean. It's just a personal preference to have romance that's mostly